What kept most of OoT's mesh programs from lowering, found by running the translator over every program
in the game's archives (mesh: 36% to 91%, all: 98.5% to 99.8%): ULOP3 with a UPn output, UPOPC of any
uniform register, ULDC, UP2UR, UISETP, the uniform vote, SEL with a uniform source, and register
shadowing for the forms that were missing it. Bumps the translator salt.

